Package: fbsamplR
Title: Facilitate Quota Sampling Using Qualtrics and Facebook Ads
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Ingmar",
           family = "Sturm",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "me@ingmarsturm.com")
Description: An R package that integrates the Facebook Marketing API and the
    Qualtrics API to automate quota-based survey sampling. Provides functions
    to manage Facebook ad campaigns and ad sets, create and manage Qualtrics
    surveys, compute quota-based sampling targets from census data, and
    conditionally activate or pause ads based on real-time survey responses.
